    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 5 11 20]\ntheorem green_18 : answer(sorry) ↔\n    ∀ α > 0, ∃ c > 0, ∃ m₀ : ℕ,\n      ∀ (G : Type*) [Group G] [Fintype G] [DecidableEq G] (A : Finset (G × G)),\n      Fintype.card G ≥ m₀ →\n      (A.card : ℝ) ≥ α * (Fintype.card G) ^ 2 →\n      (numNaiveCorners A : ℝ) ≥ c * (Fintype.card G) ^ 3",
